GATE="docs"
EXPECT_EXIT="1"
EXPECT_RULE="citation-missing-file"
DESCRIPTION="A source citation pointing at a file that does not exist. Documentation rots by referring to code that moved, and a citation is the one part of prose that can be checked mechanically. Ported from a documentation auditor on another system where validating every file:line reference drove broken citations from 65 to 0."
